==========================================================================
PART 1b  ANOMALY noticed in passing: absorbing states in the task
==========================================================================
task.py draws succ = rng.integers(N_SYM, size=N_SYM), so succ[s] == s
with probability 1/40 per symbol, and a STABLE or REVISED symbol that points at
itself is ABSORBING: the walk reaches it and never leaves. A NOISY symbol whose
option set contains itself is absorbing with probability 1/4 per step. So some
fraction of each sequence is a constant tail with a trivial prediction.

  per-sequence max prior-visit count to a single address:
    median 26   mean 68.4   max 254   (L = 256 writes per sequence)
    sequences where one address takes >  20 of the writes: 0.755
    sequences where one address takes >  60 of the writes: 0.276
    sequences where one address takes > 120 of the writes: 0.208
  share of ALL writes that land on their sequence's single most-visited address: 0.222 have >20 prior visits

